@baseUrl = http://localhost:5067

### Create product (201 Created + Location header)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Keyboard",
  "price": 199.99
}

### Create another product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mouse",
  "price": 89.50
}

### List products (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### Find product by ID (200 OK or 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1

### Validation test (400 Bad Request with field errors)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": " ",
  "price": -5
}
